OL,3,AYoung care leavers dying early a
OL,4,A'national tragedy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung adults who have left care have a
OL,7,Fdeath rate around four times higher
OL,8,Fthan the general population, a new
OL,9,Freview shows.
OL,11,FOften left alone "with no safety net,"
OL,12,Fthe report says the consequences can be
OL,13,Fcatastrophic.
OL,15,FOn turning 18, people leaving care in
OL,16,FEngland often lose "significant levers
OL,17,Fof support", the
OL,18,FGovernment-commissioned report
OL,19,Fconcluded, as it warned the so-called
OL,20,F"care cliff" must be addressed.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
