OL,3,AYoung care leavers dying early a
OL,4,A'national tragedy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio 4 Today, report
OL,7,Fco-author and broadcaster Ashley
OL,8,FJohn-Baptiste, who grew up in care,
OL,9,Fcalled the deaths a national tragedy.
